sequenceDiagram
    participant Saga as CampaignPricingSaga
    participant PricingEngine as PricingEngine
    participant CampaignRepo as CampaignRepository
    participant Bus as EventBus

    Note over Saga: Campaign pricing calculation (placeholder)

    rect rgb(240, 240, 240)
        note right of Saga: Calculate Pricing Step
        Saga->>PricingEngine: calculateCampaignCost(campaign)
        PricingEngine-->>Saga: pricingResult
    end

    rect rgb(240, 240, 240)
        note right of Saga: Update Campaign Step
        Saga->>CampaignRepo: updatePricing(campaignId, pricing)
        CampaignRepo-->>Saga: success
    end

    Saga->>Bus: publish(CampaignPricingUpdated)

    opt Compensation
        Saga->>CampaignRepo: revertPricing(campaignId)
    end
